Fung.es is licensed in two parts: an open-source app and a proprietary
forecasting engine with its data.


1. PROPRIETARY: the forecasting engine, its calibrations, models and data

Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Loris Di Stefano. All rights reserved.

This covers:

- everything under backend/ (the scoring engine, calibration and training
  tools, and the generated models and grids in backend/generated/);
- the "forecast" section of every content/species/*/species.json, and
  content/species/_host_classes.json (scoring parameters, host lists, land
  cover and their references);
- docs/species/ and scripts/qa_*.py (calibration notes and evaluation tools);
- every forecast, score, model and dataset Fung.es produces, wherever it is
  published: in this repository (for example public/data/), on fung.es or on
  data.fung.es.

These are published so they can be read. Reading them grants no licence.
